            },
            "value": {
                "none": [
                    "A brilliant and touching romantic comedy about two polar opposites, one adorable dog, and living each day to its fullest.\n\nWhen Vanessa Price quit her job to pursue her dream of traveling the globe, she wasn't expecting to gain millions of YouTube followers who shared her joy of seizing every moment. For her, living each day to its fullest isn't just a motto. Her mother and sister never saw the age of 30, and Vanessa doesn't want to take anything for granted.\n\nBut after her half-sister suddenly leaves Vanessa in custody of her infant daughter, life goes from \"daily adventure\" to \"next-level bad\" (now with bonus baby vomit in hair). The last person Vanessa expects to show up offering help is the hot lawyer next door, Adrian Copeland. After all, she barely knows him. No one warned her that he was the Secret Baby Tamer or that she'd be spending a whole lot of time with him and his geriatric Chihuahua.\n\nNow she's feeling things she's vowed not to feel. Because the only thing worse than falling for Adrian is finding a little hope for a future she may never see."
                ]
            }
